# Summary

The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter [[cite:obs-6848848caad6e5a5779dfd582363ca94b687d1bc "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]].

According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January [[cite:obs-74f8dc65e16b19105bce4a0a7a362305a433b5dd "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]].
